>Data
   Path (Datapath)</span></h2>
   <p style=3D'margin-top:5pt;margin-bottom:5pt;font-family:"Comic Sans MS";
   font-size:14.0pt' lang=3Den-US>The <span style=3D'font-weight:bold'>Data=
 Path</span>
   is the hardware responsible for <span style=3D'font-weight:bold'>actual =
data
   processing</span>. It includes all the components that manipulate and mo=
ve
   data during instruction execution.</p>
   <h3 style=3D'margin:0in;font-size:14.0pt;color:#1F3763' lang=3Den-US><sp=
an
   style=3D'font-family:"Segoe UI Emoji"'>&#128295;</span><span style=3D'fo=
nt-family:
   Calibri'> Key Components:</span></h3>
   <ul type=3Ddisc style=3D'direction:ltr;unicode-bidi:embed;margin-top:0in;
    margin-bottom:0in'>
    <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle' lang=
=3Den-US><span
        style=3D'font-weight:bold;font-family:"Comic Sans MS";font-size:14.=
0pt'>ALU
        (Arithmetic Logic Unit)</span><span style=3D'font-family:"Comic San=
s MS";
        font-size:14.0pt'>: Performs arithmetic and logical operations.</sp=
an></li>
    <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle' lang=
=3Den-US><span
        style=3D'font-weight:bold;font-family:"Comic Sans MS";font-size:14.=
0pt'>Registers</span><span
        style=3D'font-family:"Comic Sans MS";font-size:14.0pt'>: Temporary
        storage for operands and results.</span></li>
    <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle' lang=
=3Den-US><span
        style=3D'font-weight:bold;font-family:"Comic Sans MS";font-size:14.=
0pt'>Multiplexers
        (MUX)</span><span style=3D'font-family:"Comic Sans MS";font-size:14=
.0pt'>:
        Route data between components.</span></li>
    <li style=3D'margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;vertical-align:middle' lang=
=3Den-US><span
        style=3D'font-weight:bold;font-family:"Comic Sans MS";font-size:14.=
0pt'>Buses</span><span
